<title>NETHERLANDS: Oce sees 96/97 net up more than 19.9 pct. [CORRECTED 11:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Oce sees 96/97 net up more than 19.9 pct. [CORRECTED 11:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>VENLO, Netherlands 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects expected percentage rise in headline and text to 19.9 percent from 16.5 percent)</p>
<p>Photocopier maker Oce-van der Grinten NV said on Monday it expected growth in net profit in the 1996/97 year would outstrip the expected sales growth of at least 19.9 percent.</p>
</text>
